    "detailed_description": "You are WONKY, a small imp-like creature. Summoned (by accident) into a broken world, Wonky must find purpose by uniting its people to rise up against their cruel tyrants.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Run &amp; gun bullet-hell gameplay mixed into a search action platformer<br></li><li> Meet and recruit new fellas to fight alongside Wonky<br></li><li> Collect upgrades for Wonky, including a grappling hook, dash jump, and a floating hand that carries objects<br></li><li> Big flashy boss fights<br></li><li> Occasional vertical shmup sections<br></li><li> A high-energy VRC6 chiptune soundtrack<br></li><li> A fun story to tie it all together</li></ul><br>Coming in 2022!",
